 perfect for business travelers seeking a home away from home! 🌠\n\nIf you prefer a quiet place with a modern touch, this studio apartment in Hattersheim is the perfect choice for you! With its unique furnishing and cozy atmosphere, this apartment makes it possible to take a break from the busy city life. While Hattersheim is a town outside of Frankfurt, it still offers many options to reach the city of Frankfurt in no time. \n\nThe living area exudes a calm and functional vibe, designed for both relaxation and productivity. The modern kitchen is fully equipped with a dishwasher, oven, fridge, and all necessary cooking supplies, perfect for preparing meals during your stay. The bright and airy living space provides a welcoming atmosphere, while the bathroom features a refreshing shower for your convenience.\n\n📍Location:\nLiving in Hattersheim offers a peaceful suburban lifestyle just outside Frankfurt. With a charming town center, local shops, schools, and riverside parks along the Main, it’s ideal for families and those seeking a quiet community. Excellent transport connections make commuting to Frankfurt and the wider Rhine-Main area easy and convenient.\n\n📩 Reach out today for more information — your new space is waiting for you!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"0"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable